     "title": "Remember",
     "items": [
      "The weekdays and months come from Spanish, respelled the Tagalog way.",
      "Linggó is Sunday. Linggo is also used for week, as in Linggo ng Wika (National Language Week)."
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "vocab",
     "group": "more",
     "title": "More words from this lesson"
    }
   ]
  }
